          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "The solid-state structure of Rg(Th-m,n/p) was characterized by X-ray diffraction. Polymer films with a thickness of ca. 100 µm were prepared by dropcasting and evaporating a THF or xylene solution of Rg(Thm,n/p) on a silicon substrate followed by annealing the resulting film at 150 °C for 3 h under N2. A representative diffractogram of Rg(Th-5,4/12) is shown in Figure 8, and calculated lattice constants for all homologues are compiled in Table 2."
        }
      ],
